; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; EAStatsReporter — preset for EA "ABS v2.0"
; Load in MetaTrader 5: attach EAStatsReporter to a chart →
;   Inputs tab → "Load" → select this .set file → OK
;
; IMPORTANT: replace the Secret value below with your real
; EA_WEBHOOK_SECRET (the same value set on the Vercel server).
; Also create an eaStats doc in Sanity Studio with eaId = "abs"
; and updateMode = "realtime" BEFORE the first push.
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
WebhookURL=https://laoforextrader.com/api/ea/stats
Secret=changeme
EAID=abs
BrokerName=Markets4you
IntervalMin=60
SendOnStart=true
BootstrapChunkDays=7
PersistState=true
